OL,3,AAnti-migrant activist charged after
OL,4,Adinghy slashed in Channel
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnti-migrant activist Daniel Thomas has
OL,7,Fbeen charged with criminal damage after
OL,8,Fa video appeared to show him slashing
OL,9,Fat a dinghy in the English Channel.
OL,11,FThe 37-year-old, known to his
OL,12,Fsupporters as Danny Tommo, has also
OL,13,Fbeen charged with failing to disclose
OL,14,Fthe PIN to his phone, Hampshire Police
OL,15,Fsaid.
OL,17,FHe has been remanded in custody and is
OL,18,Fdue to appear at Basingstoke
OL,19,FMagistrates' Court via videolink on
OL,20,FFriday, the force added.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
