OL,3,AMiliband tells Iran minister UK will
OL,4,Anot tolerate 'hostile activity' on
OL,5,ABritish soil
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Foreign Office said Miliband spoke
OL,8,Fto his counterpart about "the UK's
OL,9,Funwavering resolve to combat threats
OL,10,Ffrom Iranian-linked groups in UK soil,
OL,11,Fincluding attacks on the British Jewish
OL,12,Fcommunity", and discussed war in the
OL,13,FMiddle East and a British couple
OL,14,Fdetained in Iran.
OL,16,FThere was no immediate comment from
OL,17,FAraghchi. The Islamic Republic News
OL,18,FAgency reported the men met and
OL,19,F"discussed bilateral ties and
OL,20,Finternational developments during their
OL,21,Ftalks".
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
