OL,3,AMedia outlets banned by Trump denied
OL,4,Aaccess to White House dinner despite
OL,5,Ajudge's order
OL,6,
OL,7,FJournalists with the three outlets were
OL,8,Fallowed back in on Thursday morning.
OL,10,FThen in the evening, a CNN reporter and
OL,11,Fa producer and an MS NOW reporter said
OL,12,Fthat they were denied entry to cover
OL,13,Fthe guests arriving for a state dinner
OL,14,Ffor Chinese leader Xi Jinping.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
